%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NeedTheCustomers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 2
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You say you need the customers? For what reason?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Seems to me like you'd prefer to be without them.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, yeah, but...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...if I tell you, you're just going to think even less of me.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Like that's even possible.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm sure that whatever reason you have for continuing to interact
      with these people should be crucial enough to be so hesitant about letting
      them go. Tell me.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ....aghhh, fineeee...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I, uh, kind of...use the customers as...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...talking...practice...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Talking practice?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Yeah, like...just learning how to talk to people...seeing what
      works and what doesn't...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You know...that stuff......
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What could you possibly need practice for? Is socialization not
      just a natural part of human life?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You basically get enough experience for it by simply existing,
      if I'm being honest.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That's easy for you to say!!! You're nothing like me!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: How so?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...as if I'm telling you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ba22cf812ea822458d34d49423a97c3, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jessi.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: AHHH FINE, since we're learning SO MUCH about me today!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I...I never got to "simply exist," okay?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I barely talked to anyone up until a year or two ago when I opened
      this place.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Not even because I just didn't want to; believe me, I really wanted
      to.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But that chance was robbed from me before I could even reach for
      it. So I just...never got to do it.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: There. Is that good enough for you?
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Mm...not quite.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: '"Robbed from me?" Those are some choice words. I''ll have to
      press her even more.'
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Force it out of her
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Be subtle about it
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49ac67e3b50c7e849a8543b56b43b15c, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7c0c35f315b94d428844f9d90f09321, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
